From: z060142 <z060142@yahoo.com.tw>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 03:19:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 192/206] feat: local light injection (r_LPVPointLights) - v2
 complete

CE3 LPVPostinjectLight equivalent: up to 16 deferred point lights add an
outward flowing lobe (60% radial cosine + 40% isotropic) with quadratic
distance falloff to the final grid - no bounce, no propagation, a cheap
local ambient glow that follows the scene's real lights into the GI.

Folded into the temporal pass (injected before the EMA blend, so the
accumulation history stays consistent): a separate pass would need a
typed RGBA16F UAV read-modify-write, which is an optional hardware
feature on D3D11. The light set is hashed (quarter-meter position /
coarse colour quantization) into the relight criteria, so moving or
toggled lights re-light immediately while static ones cost nothing.
Gain is decoupled from r_LPVIntensity like the sky light: 1 gives a
surface at the light centre roughly the light colour as ambient.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
